{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.m_W_over_m_Z_eq_cos_theta_W","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.m_W_over_m_Z_eq_cos_theta_W","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L101-L118","doc":"The W/Z ratio identity: $m_W / m_Z = \\\\cos\\\\theta_W$.\n\nThis is the SM electroweak symmetry-breaking relation. The proof\nis mechanical algebra from the definitions of `m_W_GeV`, `m_Z_GeV`,\nand `cos_theta_W_def`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.m_H_GeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.m_H_GeV","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L97-L99","doc":"Higgs boson mass: $m_H = \\\\sqrt{2\\\\lambda}\\,v$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.m_Z_GeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.m_Z_GeV","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L93-L95","doc":"Z boson mass: $m_Z = \\\\sqrt{g^2 + g'^2}\\,v/2$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.m_W_GeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.m_W_GeV","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L89-L91","doc":"W± boson mass: $m_W = gv/2$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.cos_theta_W_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.cos_theta_W_def","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L81-L81","doc":"Definition: $\\\\cos\\\\theta_W = g/\\\\sqrt{g^2 + g'^2}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.cos_theta_W","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.cos_theta_W","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L79-L79","doc":"The Weinberg angle $\\theta_W$ derived from gauge couplings:\n$\\\\cos\\\\theta_W = g / \\\\sqrt{g^2 + g'^2}$.\n\nThe SM W/Z mass ratio is $m_W/m_Z = \\\\cos\\\\theta_W$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.higgs_self_coupling_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.higgs_self_coupling_pos","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L73-L73","doc":"The Higgs self-coupling is positive (vacuum stability). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.higgs_self_coupling","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.higgs_self_coupling","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L71-L71","doc":"The Higgs self-coupling $\\lambda$.\nSM measured value: $\\lambda \\approx 0.129$ at the EW scale. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.gauge_couplings_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.gauge_couplings_pos","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L67-L67","doc":"Both gauge couplings are positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.gauge_coupling_g_prime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.gauge_coupling_g_prime","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L65-L65","doc":"The $\\mathrm{U}(1)_Y$ gauge coupling $g'$.\nSM measured value: $g' \\approx 0.3574$ at the $Z$ scale. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.gauge_coupling_g","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.gauge_coupling_g","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L62-L62","doc":"The $\\mathrm{SU}(2)_L$ gauge coupling $g$.\nSM measured value: $g \\approx 0.6520$ at the $Z$ scale. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.vev_lower_component_eq_v_over_sqrt2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.vev_lower_component_eq_v_over_sqrt2","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The doublet decomposition: $\\\\langle \\\\Phi \\\\rangle_{\\\\text{lower}} = v / \\\\sqrt{2}$.\nThis is the SM CONVENTION for the Higgs-doublet VEV; the\n$\\sqrt{2}$ comes from the doublet's component structure\n($\\Phi \\in V_{1/2, 1/2}$), not from a deeper categorical fact. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.vev_lower_component_GeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.vev_lower_component_GeV","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The Higgs doublet's lower-component VEV value: $v/\\sqrt{2}$.\nThis is the SM convention where the doublet is parametrised as\n$\\Phi = (\\phi^+, \\phi^0)^\\top$ with $\\langle \\phi^0 \\rangle = v/\\sqrt{2}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.vev_v_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.vev_v_pos","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The VEV is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.vev_v_GeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.vev_v_GeV","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The vacuum expectation value scalar $v$ in GeV.\nSM measured value: $v \\approx 246\\;\\text{GeV}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalHiggsIdempotent","kind":"class","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/CategoricalHiggsIdempotent.lean#L37-L83","doc":"Categorical Higgs idempotent $e_H \\\\colon A \\\\to A$ projecting onto\nunbroken $\\\\mathrm{U}(1)_{em}$, with explicit doublet structure\n+ VEV decomposition + gauge couplings + mass-generation rules.\n\nRefined version (2026-05-24): encodes the structural origin of\nthe $\\sqrt{2}$ in $m_W = gv/2 = g \\cdot (v/\\sqrt{2})/\\sqrt{2}$. ","signatureChunk":0}]}